# The Mouse: Thanksgiving's Cover, as the gnome is Halloween's. Up on its
# hind legs, sticking to its receiver: big round ears, a pointed snout with
# a pink nose, little arms out, and a tail up behind.
size 7 9 5
voxel 0.1
colors
  P purple
  d purpleDark
  l purpleLight
  w white
  k ink
  n candyPink
# Feet and body, a pale belly.
box 2 0 1 2 0 2 d
box 4 0 1 4 0 2 d
box 2 1 1 4 4 3 P
box 3 1 1 3 3 1 l
# Arms.
box 1 3 1 1 3 2 P
box 5 3 1 5 3 2 P
# Head, snout and nose, eyes.
box 2 5 1 4 7 3 P
box 3 5 0 3 6 0 l
box 3 6 0 3 6 0 n
box 2 7 1 2 7 1 w
box 4 7 1 4 7 1 w
# Big round ears, pink inside.
box 0 7 2 1 8 3 P
box 5 7 2 6 8 3 P
box 1 7 2 1 8 2 n
box 5 7 2 5 8 2 n
# Tail.
box 3 1 4 3 3 4 d
